    "content": "# AFTERDARK (`afterdark-horror`) — Template Steering\n\n- **Mode:** Mode A (Internal Native Website) inside GenUI Studio\n- **Master Spec:** `.kiro/specs/afterdark/` (`requirements.md`, `design.md`, `tasks.md`)\n- **Scoped Engineering Rules:** `.kiro/steering/afterdark-3d-horror.md`\n- **Immersion Rule:** Enters in `#000000` full-window immersion without top chrome; `[Alt+G]` or `ESC` Pointer Lock release surfaces Studio Hub controls cleanly.\n- **Safety:** Strictly enforced Zod schema validation (`verifiedCatalog`), zero raw HTML/JSX evaluation, deterministic AABB + Circle collisions, zero `useFrame` allocations, explicit GPU disposal, and 100% procedural Web Audio synthesis.\n",
